  (alt &gap=SepThickness
    (witness gap=SepThickness variant concept
      (separates "the divider lines are 2 wide: read with a stored gap of 1, the 20-row grid fits no whole number of 9-row panels and the reading is undefined; read with the gap the separator lines give, the top drawing copies into the bottom panel")
      (input (grid
